    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d307">

                <pb facs="0379" n="371" sameAs="frus:frus1941v07/pg371"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.12/1559½</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Mexican Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Castillo Nájera</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p>The Ambassador of Mexico presents his compliments to His Excellency the Secretary
                    of State and has the honor to place in his hands a memorandum in which the
                    Mexican Government makes a brief exposition of the various problems which are
                    awaiting settlement between Mexico and the United States and of the different
                    forms which the cooperation between the two countries, which it is desirable to
                    intensify, could take in the near future.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1941-02-17">February 17,
                            1941</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d307-a1.xml" xpointer="d307-a1"/>
